  "boundary": "The exact CC BY 4.0 v1.1 Zenodo archive is accepted as one measured injection-moulding dataset package. Its 10,697 upper and 4,989 lower serial recordings are treated as 15,686 real injection-moulding trace records; all 14,882 screw-driving JSON streams are excluded. Seven filenames referenced by the lower static table are absent from the checksum-matched archive and remain an explicit source-quality limitation. Direct actual pressure, injection velocity and melt-volume channels are separated from target/state/time fields. Their scalar values remain outside the accepted sample ledger because physical units are not explicit in the raw serial headers and observed per-file timing must not be overwritten by the dataset-level approximate sampling description."
